<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $57-1/4 (FIM 264.69).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $57-1/4 (FIM 264.69).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed up $3-1/4 at $57-1/4 in New York on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 264.69 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Wednesday, Nokia A closed up 7.00 markka at 255.00.</p>
<p>Shares of Nokia gained on the New York Stock Exchange on market rumors that it was planning to merge with telecommunications rival Telefon AB L.M. Ericsson. Both companies quickly denied the rumors and market players in Stockholm said they doubted there was any basis to it.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed down $0-1/8 at $33-3/4 on Wall Street on Wednesday. The price equals about 78.02 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet rose 0.80 markka to close at 79.40 markka.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR closed up $0-5/8 at $18-7/8 in New York on Wednesday. The price corresponds to about 87.27 markka. In Helsinki, Rauma closed 0.60 lower at 88.50 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
